# The Gitrog, Ravenous Ride (6/5 trample, haste, Saddle 1): "Whenever The Gitrog deals combat damage to a player, you may sacrifice a creature that saddled it this turn.
# If you do, draw X cards, then put up to X land cards from your hand onto the battlefield tapped, where X is the sacrificed creature's power" (CR 702.171c, 701.21a, 608.2h).
# Savannah Lions (power 2) saddles it, Bot2 takes 6 from the Gitrog, Bot1 sacrifices the Lions and draws two cards (Forest, Mountain), then puts both onto the battlefield tapped;
# the Mox Ruby in the same hand is no land card and is refused.
# Bot1 sacrifices the creature while it is a 2/1, so X = 2 (not 3 nor 1).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Savannah Lions
The Gitrog, Ravenous Ride
Mox Ruby
Forest
Mountain
Swamp x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

